</section>
<section id="S8" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">8 </span>Reproducibility Statement</h2>

<div id="S8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our implementation builds on the AQLM codebase, with modifications released at <a href="https://anonymous.4open.science/r/DropbyDrop2026/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href ltx_font_typewriter">https://anonymous.4open.science/r/DropbyDrop2026/</a>, primarily affecting <span id="S8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">aq_engine.py</span>, <span id="S8.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">src/aq.py</span>, and <span id="S8.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">quantize.sh</span>.</p>
</div>
</section>
