<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Notation Summary</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Matrices are denoted by bold uppercase letters (e.g., <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{W}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝑾</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{W}</annotation></semantics></math>), vectors by bold lowercase letters (e.g., <math id="A1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝒙</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{x}</annotation></semantics></math>), and scalars by lowercase letters (e.g., <math id="A1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>). Random variables are represented using sans-serif font (e.g., <math id="A1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{W}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝖶</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{W}</annotation></semantics></math>), while deterministic quantities use the standard math font.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T1" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T1.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T1.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Symbol</span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Description</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><math id="A1.T1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mathsf{W}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{out}}\times d_{\mathrm{in}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝗪</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>out</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>in</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mathsf{W}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{out}}\times d_{\mathrm{in}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Weight matrix of a linear layer (Random variable)</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\bm{\mathsf{W}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝗪</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\bm{\mathsf{W}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Quantized reconstruction of <math id="A1.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mathsf{W}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝗪</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mathsf{W}}</annotation></semantics></math> (Random variable)</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{X}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{in}}\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑿</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>in</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{X}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{in}}\times n}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Representative input data matrix</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{\mathrm{WMSE}}(\bm{\mathsf{W}},\widehat{\bm{\mathsf{W}}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>WMSE</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝗪</mi><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝗪</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{\mathrm{WMSE}}(\bm{\mathsf{W}},\widehat{\bm{\mathsf{W}}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Weighted mean squared reconstruction error (WMSE)</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><math id="A1.T1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mathsf{Y}}=\bm{\mathsf{W}}\bm{X}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{out}}\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝗬</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝗪</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑿</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>out</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mathsf{Y}}=\bm{\mathsf{W}}\bm{X}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{out}}\times n}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">Layer output activations (Random variable)</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mathsf{y}}=\operatorname{vec}(\bm{\mathsf{Y}})\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{out}}\cdot n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝘆</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>vec</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝗬</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>out</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mathsf{y}}=\operatorname{vec}(\bm{\mathsf{Y}})\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{out}}\cdot n}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Vectorized layer output (Random variable)</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mathsf{w}}=\operatorname{vec}(\bm{\mathsf{W}})\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{out}}\cdot d_{\mathrm{in}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝘄</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>vec</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝗪</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>out</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>in</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mathsf{w}}=\operatorname{vec}(\bm{\mathsf{W}})\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{out}}\cdot d_{\mathrm{in}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Vectorized weight matrix (Random variable)</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{y}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝗒</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{y}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>-th scalar component of <math id="A1.T1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mathsf{y}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝘆</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mathsf{y}}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><math id="A1.T1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\bm{\mathsf{W}}}^{(k)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝗪</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\bm{\mathsf{W}}}^{(k)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">Partial reconstruction using the first <math id="A1.T1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> codebooks</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mathsf{Y}}^{(k)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝗬</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mathsf{Y}}^{(k)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Output produced by the <math id="A1.T1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-stage reconstruction</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{k}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Distortion level at refinement stage <math id="A1.T1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Sigma_{Y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Covariance of vectorized output <math id="A1.T1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mathsf{Y}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝗬</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mathsf{Y}}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Eigenvalues of <math id="A1.T1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Sigma_{Y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math> in Gaussian eigen-decomposition</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><math id="A1.T1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\mathrm{in}},d_{\mathrm{out}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>in</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>out</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\mathrm{in}},d_{\mathrm{out}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">Input and output dimensions of the layer</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Number of calibration samples</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>g</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Group size for partitioning weights</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Number of additive codebooks</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{m}\in\mathbb{R}^{g\times 2^{B}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></msup></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{m}\in\mathbb{R}^{g\times 2^{B}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.19.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math>-th codebook containing <math id="A1.T1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2^{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2^{B}</annotation></semantics></math> codewords</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.20" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T1.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Number of bits used to index codewords</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.2.21" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T1.2.21.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><math id="A1.T1.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{ijm}\in\{0,1\}^{2^{B}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></msup></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{ijm}\in\{0,1\}^{2^{B}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.21.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">One-hot vector selecting a codeword from codebook <math id="A1.T1.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
</table>
