<p id="A4.F9.3.5" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Layer 1: <span id="A4.F9.3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">0.0</span></p><img src="2606.12876v1/imgs/plots/March_1_FITTED_scaled_weight_hist_layer_12_Linear.png" id="A4.F9.g13" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:141/79;" width="141" height="79" alt="Refer to caption">
