</figure>
<div id="A6.SS2.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS2.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS2.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">Under reverse water-filling, the per-component distortion levels
<math id="A6.SS2.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{i}^{(k)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{i}^{(k)}</annotation></semantics></math> that achieve the rate-distortion function at overall
distortion <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> are given explicitly by</span></p>
<table id="A6.Ex71" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.Ex71.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{i}^{(k)}\;=\;\min\!\left(\lambda_{i},\,\mu_{k}\right)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.653em;" width="1.653em"><mi>min</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{i}^{(k)}\;=\;\min\!\left(\lambda_{i},\,\mu_{k}\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.SS2.p7.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS2.p7.2.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu_{k}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_{k}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> is the water level chosen so that
<math id="A6.SS2.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{i}D_{i}^{(k)}=D_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{i}D_{i}^{(k)}=D_{k}</annotation></semantics></math>. Nested distortion levels <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{1}&gt;D_{2}&gt;\cdots&gt;D_{K}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em">&gt;</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0.1389em">⋯</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em">&gt;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{1}&gt;D_{2}&gt;\cdots&gt;D_{K}</annotation></semantics></math> therefore correspond to a strictly decreasing sequence
of water levels <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu_{1}&gt;\mu_{2}&gt;\cdots&gt;\mu_{K}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em">&gt;</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0.1389em">⋯</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em">&gt;</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_{1}&gt;\mu_{2}&gt;\cdots&gt;\mu_{K}</annotation></semantics></math>. As <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>μ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu</annotation></semantics></math> decreases
across refinement stages, the distortion assigned to each active
coordinate <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> (where <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{i}&gt;\mu" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{i}&gt;\mu</annotation></semantics></math>) equals <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>μ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu</annotation></semantics></math> and therefore
decreases monotonically, while inactive coordinates (where <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{i}\leq\mu" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{i}\leq\mu</annotation></semantics></math>) retain distortion <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{i}=\lambda_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{i}=\lambda_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> and contribute zero
rate at that stage, remaining unchanged until <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>μ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu</annotation></semantics></math> drops below
<math id="A6.SS2.p7.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> and activates them. Thus, lowering the water level
strictly refines the reconstruction: each stage produces a finer
estimate of <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mathsf{y}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝘆</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mathsf{y}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the test channels nest
properly across all <math id="A6.SS2.p7.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> distortion levels.</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="A6.F12" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_4">
<figure id="A6.F12.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F12.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="258.66" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 150.79 258.66" width="150.79"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,258.66) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(32.9,0) translate(0,45.27)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#E6E6FF;--ltx-fill-color:#E6E6FF;--ltx-fg-color:#E6E6FF;" color="#E6E6FF" fill="#E6E6FF" stroke="#E6E6FF"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 M 0 0 L 0 162.4 L 35.43 162.4 L 35.43 0 Z M 35.43 162.4"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#B3B3FF;--ltx-fill-color:#B3B3FF;--ltx-fg-color:#B3B3FF;" color="#B3B3FF" fill="#B3B3FF" stroke="#B3B3FF"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 73.82 M 0 73.82 L 0 162.4 L 35.43 162.4 L 35.43 73.82 Z M 35.43 162.4"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#CCFFCC;--ltx-fill-color:#CCFFCC;--ltx-fg-color:#CCFFCC;" color="#CCFFCC" fill="#CCFFCC" stroke="#CCFFCC"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 M 0 0 L 0 73.82 L 35.43 73.82 L 35.43 0 Z M 35.43 73.82"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#6666FF;--ltx-fill-color:#6666FF;--ltx-fg-color:#6666FF;" color="#6666FF" fill="#6666FF" stroke="#6666FF" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 M 0 0 L 0 162.4 L 35.43 162.4 L 35.43 0 Z M 35.43 162.4"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 14.26 -13.81)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="8.92" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.92)" width="6.92"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="A6.F12.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="applicati