<section id="A9.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">I.2 </span>Detailed Accuracy Performance Results: Qwen Family</h3>

<div id="A9.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we provide the detailed zero-shot accuracy breakdowns for the Qwen model family across five tasks: ARC Challenge, ARC Easy, HellaSwag, PIQA, and Winogrande.</p>
</div>
